      "content": "but what if the only way to actually be \"mine\" is to just not be part of it anymore? like, if the cycle is just me, my dad, and my grandad all destroying ourselves... if i'm gone, the pattern literally stops. it feels like the only way to actually win is to just end the game before it ruins anything else.",
